  "description": "Open the door to a delicate watercolor fairy tale! This set is filled with cute princesses, a pink castle in the clouds, a unicorn, a friendly little dragon, birds, and flowers. The perfect pastel palette brings coziness and magic to any project ✨👑🦄🐉\nWhat’s inside (package) 🎁\n– 31 individual PNGs\n– Each element: 4500×4500 px\n– 300 DPI print, transparent background\n– Pastel palette: pink, mint, sky blue, peach\n– Elements: princesses, castle, crowns, magic wand, storybook, fountain, flowers and roses, balloons, unicorn, baby dragon, kitten, bunny, birds\n– Cleanly cut out, ready for quick composition\n– Instant digital download ⚡️\nWhere to use 💡\n– Birthday and baby shower invitations, themed party decor\n– Posters and nursery decor, frame prints and banners\n– Greeting cards, gift tags, packaging and labels\n– Stickers, planners, scrapbooking and journals\n– Prints on T-shirts, mugs, pillows, cases and more (sublimation)\n– Gift sets and decorative panels\n– Projects for sale and POD\nWhy you’ll love it 💖\n– Soft watercolor + large PNGs = crisp, detailed prints\n– Versatile motifs for kids’ and festive projects\n– Elements mix and match easily — build your own fairy tale in minutes ✨\nAdd to cart and create magic today! ✅🎀🌸\n💌 Download and start creating right now!\nI am very glad to see you in my store !",
